@gateway = http://localhost:19080
@accounts = http://localhost:19081
@transactions = http://localhost:19082
# Remplacer avec les UUID obtenus par GET /api/accounts.
@sourceId = remplacer-uuid-source
@targetId = remplacer-uuid-beneficiaire

### Lister les comptes
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts

### Créer un compte
POST {{gateway}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerReference":"CLIENT-004","currency":"MAD","balance":1500.00}

### Consulter un compte
GET {{gateway}}/api/accounts/{{sourceId}}

### Bloquer un compte (remplacer BLOCKED par ACTIVE pour réactiver)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/accounts/{{sourceId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"BLOCKED"}

### Paiement
POST {{gateway}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{sourceId}}","amount":250.00,"currency":"MAD","merchantCategory":"SHOPPING","country":"MA"}

### Virement
POST {{gateway}}/api/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceAccountId":"{{sourceId}}","targetAccountId":"{{targetId}}","amount":100.00,"currency":"MAD"}

### Historique d'un compte, incluant les virements reçus
GET {{gateway}}/api/transactions?accountId={{sourceId}}

### Plafond utilisé
GET {{gateway}}/api/transactions/config

### Configuration centralisée
GET http://localhost:19888/transaction-service/default

### GraphQL comptes via gateway
POST {{gateway}}/accounts/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"{ accounts { id customerReference balance currency status } }"}

### GraphQL création de compte
POST {{accounts}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation { createAccount(input: {customerReference: \"CLIENT-GQL\", currency: \"EUR\", balance: \"500.00\"}) { id balance } }"}

### GraphQL transaction
POST {{transactions}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation($input: CreateTransactionInput!) { createTransaction(input: $input) { id amount createdAt } }","variables":{"input":{"accountId":"{{sourceId}}","amount":"20.00","currency":"MAD","merchantCategory":"FOOD","country":"MA"}}}

### Chatbot Gemini (nécessite -WithAi)
POST {{gateway}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Liste mes comptes avec leurs soldes et identifiants."}

### Initialiser une session MCP (conserver le header Mcp-Session-Id de la réponse)
POST {{accounts}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-03-26","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"tp-client","version":"1.0"}}}

### Ensuite : notification notifications/initialized puis tools/list et tools/call
# Pour les appels suivants, ajouter le header Mcp-Session-Id et MCP-Protocol-Version.
